Package: MongrelDB
Type: Package
Title: Pure R Client for MongrelDB
Version: 0.58.1
Date: 2026-07-08
Authors@R: person("Visorcraft", email = "noreply@visorcraft.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Visorcraft [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Visorcraft <noreply@visorcraft.com>
Description: A pure R HTTP client for mongreldb-server. Talks JSON over the
    Kit transaction, query, and SQL endpoints, with a typed condition() error
    hierarchy and a native query builder. Depends on the 'curl' package for the
    HTTP transport.
